   "stem_html": "<p>“We know that the ancient laws of your imperial majesty’s government do not allow of foreign trade, except with the Chinese and the Dutch; but as the state of the world changes and new governments are formed, it seems to be wise, from time to time, to make new laws.”</p>\n<p align=\"right\">President Millard Fillmore, Letter to His Imperial Majesty, the Emperor of Japan, November 13, 1852</p>\n<p><i>Refer to the excerpt provided.</i></p>\n<p>This  letter was sent to the leader of</p>",
